Bundled fonts
-------------
This distribution redistributes three font families as WOFF2 binaries in
resources/ui/fonts/, so that no page has to fetch a font from a third-party CDN:

    Montserrat      Copyright The Montserrat Project Authors
    Overpass        Copyright The Overpass Project Authors
    JetBrains Mono  Copyright The JetBrains Mono Project Authors

All three are licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1, and that
licence requires its text to be distributed with the fonts. The full text of each
is therefore bundled beside the binaries:

    resources/ui/fonts/OFL-Montserrat.txt
    resources/ui/fonts/OFL-Overpass.txt
    resources/ui/fonts/OFL-JetBrainsMono.txt

resources/ui/fonts/fonts.manifest.json records the upstream source of every file,
pinned to a commit, along with the coverage each face is verified to have.
